=2 Walkthrough
* Talk to {n:Roskin} in {z:Eastern Adoulin} (H-8) to start the quest. He will give you {k:Elder wooden box} KI.
** You must zone following {q:A Thirst for the Eons|A Thirst for the Eons|A Thirst for the Eons} in order to receive this quest.
* Talk to {n:Palomel} in {z:Eastern Adoulin} near {p:Scouts' Coalition} to appraise your {k:Elder wooden box} into {k:Imprint device S} KI.
* Talk to {n:Quwi Orihbhe} in {z:Rabao}, (G-8) near {p:Proto-Waypoint}.
* Talk to {n:Roskin} again.

Mnemonic Pool locations:
* {z:Ceizak Battlegrounds} eastern side of (F-6) - {k:Record of a thousand lights} KI.

:* Fastest route is via {z:Yahse Hunting Grounds} Bivouac #2.
:* Go south to (F-11) to enter {z:Ceizak Battlegrounds} near the Pool.

* {z:Cirdas Caverns} southern side of (H-8) - {k:Record of a cavernous foray} KI.

:* Fastest route into Cirdas is by heading west from the Yorcia Weald Frontier Station Waypoint.
:* After you get this cutscene, you can return the way you came to get the next one below.

* {z:Yorcia Weald} northwest corner of (J-9) - {k:Record of the generals' foray} KI.

:* Fastest route is via the Frontier Station.

* {z:Kamihr Drifts} eastern side of the chasm at (G-8) - {k:Record of the knight in black} KI.

:* Fastest route is via the Bivouac #3.

Once you've collected all four key items, return to {n:Roskin} in {z:Eastern Adoulin} to complete the quest.
=3 Optional
* This section is **NOT** optional should you want to do the next quest. It is only optional, if you don't plan on beginning the next quest in the series.
* Talk to {n:Palomel} for an additional cutscene.
* Zone and talk to Roskin to begin the Optional Section!
* Roskin will ask you to retrieve a book from {z:Celennia Memorial Library}.
* Check the History stacks in the library to start a pop quiz on Adoulinian politics and zoology.
* You will need to answer 12 questions without timing out.
** Timing out will instantly stop the pop quiz.
** Upon failure you must rezone to try again, but you will have more time to answer per question, and the total number of questions will increase.
** Some questions are general trivia:
*** The name of the bridge connecting Eastern and Western Adoulin is The Big Bridge.
*** Raptor fights are held in the Watergarden Coliseum.
*** The fountain in Western Adoulin is the Font Xanira.
*** Celennia Wexworth hailed from Rhazowa.
*** Sverdhried was the father of rune fencing.
*** The Rala Waterways were constructed 200 years ago.
*** Cafe de Larmes is located in Eastern Adoulin.
*** The Inventors' Coalition is in charge of adjusting waypoints.
*** The small outlying islands rented out to pioneers are called Mog Gardens.
*** The sea east of the isles of Adoulin is the Sea of Shu'Meyo.
** You are expected to know the names of the six Naakuals, their codenames, where they reside, and what species they have dominion over. This can all be found in the Bestiary stack.
*** The Matriarch Naakual is Colkhab, resides in Ceizak, and has dominion over vermin.
*** The Firebrand Naakual is Achuka, resides in Morimar, and has dominion over lizards.
*** The Riptide Naakual is Tchakka, resides in Foret de Hennetiel, and has dominion over aquans.
*** The Ligneous Naakual is Yumcax, resides in Yorcia, and has dominion over plantoids.
*** The Booming Naakual is Hurkan, resides in Marjami, and has dominion over birds.
*** The Flashfrost Naakual is Kumhau, resides in Kamihr, and has dominion over beasts.
*** Pungent Fungi reside in Cirdas Caverns.
*** The Zoldeff River runs through Foret de Hennetiel.
** You are expected to know the names of the Twelve Orders, who leads them, what role they serve, their administrative positions, and the emblem:
*** Adoulin is headed by either Ygnas or Arciela, **depending on your progression through the story.**
**** The king's lineage was originally held by the Order of Adoulin.
*** The Minister of Finance is Melvien.
**** Woltaris' symbol is a leaf.
*** The order of Haverton leads the Scouts' Coalition.
**** The marquee of the order of Haverton is a rune fencer.
*** Janniston is located in Platea Triumphus.
*** Weatherspoon's leader is the Minister of Judication.
**** Vortimere is the current Archexorcist.
**** Exorcisms are performed in the Exorcists' Priory.
*** Gorney's leader is the Minister of Commerce.
*** Vocane is in the Peacekeepers' Coalition.
*** Karieyh's symbol is a monkey.
*** Renaye is headed by Ikhi Askamot.
*** Shneddick is headed by Reginald.
*** Flaviria is the leader of the Thurandaut Order.
*** The pioneer's coalition role is to register pioneers.
*** Civic Arboretum is the name of the area in Rala Waterways used to grow vegetables for the populace.
*** Leafkin can be found in Leafallia.
*** Lizard species of creature can be found in Morimar Basalt Fields.
*** Beasts are the majority type of creature found in Kamihr Drifts.
*** Scouts Coalition controls the Celennia Memorial Library.
*** In Cirdas Caverns one can find pungent fungi.
*** Exorcist Priory is the name of the edifice where the exorcists practice their craft.
* After the quiz you will receive {k:Heroes and Legends of Adoulin}.
* You will also receive a "Speedy Score" based on how long your quiz took.
* Talk to {n:Roskin}. __At this point the quest is now listed as Completed in your logs, but you must zone do the next steps in order to access the next quest in the series.__
* After a game day talk to {n:Roskin} again to receive 2 bayld and 1-3 random {p:skill-up books|Sparks}.
** The History stacks in the Library will have new entries corresponding to Roskin's additions.
** Talking to {n:Roskin} once per Conquest Tally will earn you another 2 bayld and 1-3 random skill-up books.

